  info [
    "LSLAM-ENV-A2 Earth-like aerial environment."
    "A3d: earth_aerial terrain; spawn SW (-150,-150); 300x300 m rectangle (tilt+FOV margin at 5 m/s)."
    "Gravity 9.81 m/s^2 (Earth). Robot/sensors reused from Mars experiment."
